I've updated my jFlash program. It can now do recall testing as well as
recognition.
Still missing is a review screen and drop back handling. 

I've made a jar file available for anyone who wants to test. (See
http://lojban.sourceforge.net).

I've also modified the JavaGismu utility (allows you to search the gismu
list by gismu and rafsi), it is now available as an application as well as
an applet. See the same page for download.





